      "body": "### 地址\nhttps://github.com/fruitSandwich/aiGomokuBattle\n\n### 介绍\nLLM vs LLM / Human vs LLM 五子棋对战平台。让大模型在棋盘上对决，或者亲自挑战 AI。\n\n- AI vs AI — 两个 LLM 自动对弈，旁观 AI 的棋力与策略\n- Human vs AI — 你和 LLM 下一盘，每一步 AI 实时响应\n\n\n### 截图\n配置模型\n<img width=\"3250\" height=\"1380\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e055116d-97d2-489f-bce6-9978bc35ee2a\" />\n\n对战\n\n<img width=\"1000\" height=\"428\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c21b6b74-f415-4eae-915d-35bddd853cd1\" />\n\n<img width=\"2646\" height=\"1636\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/16610d65-25ab-47ef-9046-e745fd697008\" />\n\n每一步的决策以及和大模型交互的请求\n\n<img width=\"1272\" height=\"1011\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d8c20f44-45fe-4ff9-b996-2efdabe7aada\" />\n\n<img width=\"2654\" height=\"1970\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b8aa655f-31ec-4dfa-93f4-0601d9dcdc96\" />\n\n",
